<Base lang="en" page="privacy" title="Privacy · Traces Blanches" description="What stays on your phone and what the Traces Blanches server receives: the download and the update of the packs, nothing else.">
<div class="text">
<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p class="lead">Your position, your tracks and your plans stay on your phone. The server only receives the requests for the packs you download.</p>
<div class="status"><p><b>The app is not published yet.</b> This page describes what the code of the app does. It will be updated before the release on Google Play, and every change will remain visible in <a rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/tracesblanches/tracesblanches.github.io/commits/main/src/pages/privacy.astro">the history of this page</a>. The <a href="/fr/confidentialite.html" hreflang="fr">French version</a> is the reference.</p></div>
<ul class="toc">
<li><a href="#phone">On the phone</a></li>
<li><a href="#server">What the server receives</a></li>
<li><a href="#never">What we do not do</a></li>
